  "content": "<p><b>Privacy Policy:</b> HI This Privacy Policy explains how our Learning Program collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal information when you enroll in and use our educational services, including but not limited to registration details (such as your name, email address, contact information, and payment details), academic information (such as course progress, assessments, certifications, and feedback), and technical data (such as IP address, device information, browser type, and usage analytics); by accessing or using the Learning Program, you consent to the collection and processing of your data for purposes including account creation, course delivery, progress tracking, communication, customer support, service improvement, security monitoring, and compliance with applicable laws; we implement appropriate administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction; we do not sell your personal data to third parties, and we may share limited information with trusted service providers solely to operate and improve the program under strict confidentiality obligations; we retain your information only as long as necessary to fulfill educational and legal requirements; you have the right to access, correct, update, or request deletion of your personal information subject to applicable legal limitations; and we may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, with changes becoming effective upon publication within the Learning Program.</p>",
